      "Launching of the First Liquid\nFuel Rocket\nMarch 16, 1926 • Auburn, Massachusetts, U.S.A.\nROBERT H. GODDARD\nU.S.AIR MAIL O\n16\n1984\n01501\nUSA\n20c",
